<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<chapter xml:id="ch-fractions-decimals-percentages" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Fractions, Decimals, Percentages, and Ratio</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Fractions, decimals, and percentages are three ways of representing the same rational number.
      Moving fluently between them — and using ratio and proportion — is essential for everyday mathematics and for all other strands.
    </p>
  </introduction>

